The {{Term/Store|Evil Spirit Mask||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Phantom Ganon Skull||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> is a recurring [[Item]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Phantom Ganon Skull is a piece of [[Armor]] exclusive to {{TCB}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack. Obtaining the Phantom Ganon Skull is one part of the objective of the "[[EX Treasure: Dark Armor]]" [[Side Quest]]. The Skull was stolen from [[Hyrule Castle (Dungeon)|Hyrule Castle]] by [[Misko]] and a clue to its location can be found in ''[[Misko's EX Journal 2]]'' at the [[Deya Village Ruins]].<ref name="BotW Misko's EX Journal 2"/><ref name="BotW Misko's EX Journal 2 2"/> The [[Hidden Chest]] that contains the Phantom Ganon Skull can be found submerged under the highest of the three [[Floria Falls]] flowing south from [[Corta Lake]] to [[Lake Floria]]. Link must use the [[Magnesis]] [[Rune]] to pull the Chest from the [[Waterfall]] to retrieve it.

When worn, the Skull provides one level of [[Stealth Up]]. The Phantom Ganon Skull cannot be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] nor can it be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Phantom Ganon Skull, alongside the [[Phantom Ganon Armor]] and [[Phantom Ganon Greaves]], compose the [[Phantom Ganon Set]].

According to its description, it is believed that the Phantom Ganon Skull is infused with a [[Phantom Ganon|dark entity]] that resembles the [[Ganon|Great King of Evil]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> After obtaining the Phantom Ganon Skull, [[Granté]] in [[Tarrey Town]] will begin selling it for 50 [[Rupee]]s.

